The local VoiceFoundation.h extends declarations in the umbrella. Keep it
textual, like NSPathUtilities.h, so Clang's C++20 module build visits it in
the same context as Foundation.h. This fixes the missing NSUInteger
diagnostic in the Foundation Objective-C++ module probe.

--- a/Modules/module.modulemap
+++ b/Modules/module.modulemap
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
   umbrella header "Foundation.h"
   textual header "NSObjCRuntime.h"
   textual header "NSPathUtilities.h"
+  textual header "VoiceFoundation.h"
   textual header "NSRange.h"
   textual header "NSObject.h"
   textual header "NSString.h"
